    "type": "question",
    "label": "52",
    "prompt": "Factorise the following.\n$$x^2+2xy-15y^2$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x+5y)(x-3y)$",
      "worked": "The cross terms are $5xy-3xy=2xy$, and $(5y)(-3y)=-15y^2$.\n$$x^2+2xy-15y^2=(x+5y)(x-3y).$$",
